<title>UK: UK Jan 30 gilt auction announcement - full details.</title>
<headline>UK Jan 30 gilt auction announcement - full details.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Bank of England</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>AMOUNT:1.5 BLN STG</p>
<p>COUPON: 7.0 PERCENT</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2002</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: JAN 30</p>
<p>NOTES:The new gilts will be fully fungible with the relevent stock already in issue. The new gilts will be strippable when the strips facility starts.</p>
</text>
